OL,5,G0200 My Top Twelve: Ralph McTell
OL,6,     FIn this 1976 broadcast, folk icon
OL,7,     FRalph McTell joins host Brian
OL,8,     FMatthew to share 12 defining
OL,9,     Ftracks, exploring the traditional
OL,10,     Fblues and acoustic roots that
OL,11,     Fshaped his music.
OL,12,G0300 6 Music Live Hour
OL,13,     FColdplay headline the Pyramid
OL,14,     FStage at Glastonbury 2011, plus a
OL,15,     Fsession by Spooks recorded on 20
OL,16,     FJanuary 2004 and one by I'm Being
OL,17,     FGood from September 1994.
OL,18,G0400 6 Music Jukebox
OL,19,     FSoundtrack the early hours with
OL,20,     Fback-to-back music, plus exclusive
OL,21,     FBBC sessions.
